<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Processing Meshes</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="101.026%" size="4" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Scan data produced by KUBE can be transformed in polygonised surfaces called meshes. Because of their structure meshes are easy to process with variety of tools. Many CAD packages use similar data formats, so converting scans to meshes will afford an opportunity for exporting KUBE data to other applications. Meshes are created by merging and polygon reduction. Another way of getting a mesh is by importing it from another program. This is usually a CAD model that is later used for comparing with the scan data produced in KUBE.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Operations valid for meshes are mainly divided in the following groups:</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Data reduction functions</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">:</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/merge.htm">Merge</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/volume_3d_sampling_Mesh.htm">Volume Sampling</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/Polygon_Reduction.htm">Polygon Reduction</a></span><span class="Command" style="font-weight:normal;">, and</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/define_xy_grid_Mesh.htm">Define XY Grid</a>.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Noise reduction functions</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">:</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/average_noise_reduction_Mesh.htm">Average</a>, <a href="../../References/noise_reduction_by_curvature.htm">By Curvature</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">, and</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/interactive_noise_reduction_by_curvature.htm">Interactive</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Post-processing functions</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">:</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/fill.htm">Fill</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/Stitch.htm">Stitch</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">, <a href="../../References/Repair.htm" style="font-weight:normal;">Repair</a>, <a href="../../References/cap.htm" style="font-weight:normal;">Cap</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/smooth_boundaries.htm">Smooth Boundaries</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/enhance_features.htm">Enhance Features</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/reorganise.htm">Reorganise</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/subdivide.htm">Subdivide</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/weld.htm">Weld</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/remove_faulty_areas.htm">Remove Faulty Areas</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/remove_floating_meshes.htm">Remove Floating Meshes</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/remove_duplicate_triangles.htm">Remove Duplicate Triangles</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">, <a href="../../References/Optimise_Meshes.htm" style="font-weight:normal;">Optimise Meshes</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">, and</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/batch.htm">Batch</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet" style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB">Instant functions: <a href="../../References/instant_editing.htm" style="font-weight:normal;">Instant post-processing</a></span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Functions dealing with normals</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">:</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/flip_normals.htm">Flip</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/unify_normals.htm">Unify</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">, and</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/unify_normals_interactive.htm">Unify Interactive</a></span><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Miscellaneous functions</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">:</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/Offset_Points.htm">Offset Points</a>, <a href="../../References/Scale_Points.htm">Scale</a>, <a href="../../References/split_mesh.htm">Split Mesh</a></span><span class="Command" style="font-weight:normal;">, and</span> <span class="Command"><a href="../../References/cut_polygonal_area.htm">Cut (Polygonal Area)</a>.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">For details about the mesh operations, please refer to the correspondent functions.</span></p>
